  {"code":"19022","name":"Searching for Dragon Sign","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":6,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Withered Heath","stage":"1A","keywords":{},"timings":["setup","forced","constant"],"text":"Setup: Set Cold-Drake and all four copies of Dragon Sign aside, out of play. Create the Caves deck (see insert) and set it next to the quest deck. Shuffle 2 set aside Dragon Sign objectives into the Caves deck. Shuffle the encounter deck and discard cards from the top until X locations are discarded, where X is the number of players. Add each discarded location to the staging area.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Forced: After the active location is explored, look at the top 3 cards of the encounter deck. Reveal 1 of those cards and discard the rest.\nThe players cannot defeat this stage unless at least 1 Dragon Sign is in the victory display.","questPoints":6,"stage":"1B"},"printings":[{"pack":"TWH","number":22,"hobSlug":"Searching-for-Dragon-Sign-TWH","octgnGuid":"21786f6e-9f9c-4850-9277-9ee77b6e0912","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/21786f6e-9f9c-4850-9277-9ee77b6e0912.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/Searching-for-Dragon-Sign-1A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/Searching-for-Dragon-Sign-1B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"19023","name":"The Cold-Drake Attacks!","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":3,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Withered Heath","stage":"2A","keywords":{},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant","constant","constant","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Add the set-aside Cold-Drake to the staging area.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Ignore the Deep keyword.\nCold-Drake cannot leave the staging area (even if it has damage equal to its hit points), but it is considered to be engaged with each player.\nNo more than 6 damage can be placed on Cold-Drake each round, and it cannot have more than 18 damage.\nThis stage cannot be defeated while Cold-Drake has hit points remaining.","questPoints":3,"stage":"2B"},"printings":[{"pack":"TWH","number":23,"hobSlug":"The-Cold-Drake-Attacks-TWH","octgnGuid":"60ba0781-d051-46f0-97b1-e02fb637b94e","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/60ba0781-d051-46f0-97b1-e02fb637b94e.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/The-Cold-Drake-Attacks-2A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/The-Cold-Drake-Attacks-2B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"19024","name":"Hunting the Beast","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":9,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Withered Heath","stage":"3A","keywords":{},"timings":["whenRevealed","forced","forced","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Shuffle 2 set-aside Dragon Sign objectives into the Caves deck. Set Cold-Drake aside, out of play. (Do not remove damage tokens from it.) Shuffle the encounter discard pile into the encounter deck and discard cards from the top until X locations are discarded, where X is the number of players. Add each discarded location to the staging area.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Forced: After the active location is explored, look at the top 3 cards of the encounter deck. Reveal 1 of those cards and discard the rest.\nForced: At the end of the round, remove 3 damage tokens from the set-aside Cold-Drake.\nThe players cannot defeat this stage unless at least 3 Dragon Signs are in the victory display.","questPoints":9,"stage":"3B"},"printings":[{"pack":"TWH","number":24,"hobSlug":"Hunting-the-Beast-TWH","octgnGuid":"e70fa96c-f4c7-4d6c-ab14-41831a6eb8c8","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/e70fa96c-f4c7-4d6c-ab14-41831a6eb8c8.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/Hunting-the-Beast-3A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/Hunting-the-Beast-3B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"19025","name":"A Cornered Dragon","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":0,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Withered Heath","stage":"4A","keywords":{},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant","forced","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Add Cold-Drake to the staging area. It makes an immediate attack against each player in turn order. (Deal and resolve a shadow card for each attack.)","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Cold-Drake cannot take more than X damage each round, where X is the number of Dragon Signs in the victory display.\nForced: At the beginning of the quest phase, return Cold-Drake to the staging area. It makes an immediate attack against each player in turn order.\nThis stage cannot be defeated while Cold-Drake is in play. When Cold-Drake is defeated, the players win the game.","questPoints":0,"stage":"4B"},"printings":[{"pack":"TWH","number":25,"hobSlug":"A-Cornered-Dragon-TWH","octgnGuid":"9656a1c9-dd90-4096-b2ba-eb2491d08403","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/9656a1c9-dd90-4096-b2ba-eb2491d08403.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/A-Cornered-Dragon-4A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Withered-Heath/A-Cornered-Dragon-4B.jpg"]}]}
